{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1649 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "1c9c821e4ca0854201af81067ea58bb0de17c7c34d9d581566fa4a48eb6fa4c4" :edb/db-before-t 1648 :edb/db-after-t 1649 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534961 50 #inst "2026-10-08T12:14:47.581Z" 13194139534961 true] [17592186096587 1020 #edb/ref 17592186322782 13194139534961 true] [17592186096589 1020 #edb/ref 17592186322789 13194139534961 true] [17592186303654 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/assets/d1d49c23cebfe2979c8bff7b7f19d5435807a8d1aec348070aadfab1e9d2ca19.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y={x}^{2}-{sin}^{2}⁡(x),$ the $x$-axis, and the lines $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ and $x=\\pi ,$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534961 true] [17592186303654 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039635/assets/d1d49c23cebfe2979c8bff7b7f19d5435807a8d1aec348070aadfab1e9d2ca19.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y={x}^{2}-{sin}^{2}⁡(x),$ the $x$-axis, and the lines $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ and $x=\\pi ,$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534961 false] [17592186322782 1017 #edb/ref 17592186322783 13194139534961 true] [17592186322782 1089 "q-10457" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322782 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534961 true] [17592186322782 1100 "$\\int (5{cos}^{2}⁡2x-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322782 1113 #uuid "06c70e02-23ad-5443-a5fb-c80cbe357a8a" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322782 1145 "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta $ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5{cos}^{2}⁡2x-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x & =\\int [5\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5}{2}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322784 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322785 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322786 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322787 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322788 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1041 "selection" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322786 13194139534961 true] [17592186322783 1110 #uuid "90c95b81-784e-545f-b0aa-64791a51987d" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322784 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x-\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322784 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322784 1111 #uuid "bc92887d-99d9-555e-b40c-0f2a8cfe6088" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322785 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322785 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322785 1111 #uuid "1c854187-c69d-511b-bf1d-22b1420dffb6" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322786 1034 "\\frac{5}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322786 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322786 1111 #uuid "3b1e5dec-e6c4-5bb1-bf0b-abdcefca5d61" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322787 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322787 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322787 1111 #uuid "b03d6d44-84f1-5dba-9479-2420747d3099" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322788 1034 "\\frac{5}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x-\\frac{5x}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+C" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322788 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322788 1111 #uuid "cffb20fa-7eba-5d2b-b681-2ebb1ded0c5b" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1017 #edb/ref 17592186322790 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1089 "q-348729" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14044295/assets/86e34aa6aff8f62f1913d2f432f1236d651d3813647e512d398b51c7b7ce48f7.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y=2{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)-2{sin}^{2}⁡(3x)+{x}^{2}+4,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=0$ and $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ as shown above. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1113 #uuid "f34f0a6f-8979-5811-a521-97c97827cf5e" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322789 1145 "The area of the region is given by\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(2{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)-2{sin}^{2}⁡(3x)+{x}^{2}+4)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTo calculate this integral, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x={cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite the above formula as\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x=2{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)-2{sin}^{2}⁡(3x).\n$$\n\nHence, the area of the region is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(2{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)-2{sin}^{2}⁡(3x)+{x}^{2}+4)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡6x+{x}^{2}+4)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡6x+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+4x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =[\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3\\pi )+\\frac{(\\pi /2)^{3}}{3}+4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2}]-[\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)+\\frac{{0}^{3}}{3}+4\\cdot 0] \\\\  & =[0+\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}}{24}+2\\pi ]-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{3}}{24}+2\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322791 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322792 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1041 "field-1" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322792 13194139534961 true] [17592186322790 1110 #uuid "7a450a45-cba6-507b-a0ba-ed744d52c62c" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322791 1034 "2\\pi" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322791 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322791 1111 #uuid "f9705a38-cddc-5894-a460-4cfbb6148a73" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322792 1034 "\\frac{\\pi^3}{24}+2\\pi" 13194139534961 true] [17592186322792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534961 true] [17592186322792 1111 #uuid "666ddb1e-2cb5-58ee-8815-28fa52c77d78" 13194139534961 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-10457" 17592186322782 "q-10457/selection" 17592186322783 "q-10457/selection/16889c67b2d4380bc535a70c05af9f8c537e994120d49c3f479a072dce3b116e" 17592186322784 "q-10457/selection/9a32da931d487271c705bd6e14e3c3d77ee4e5a4209a5f2347c7c5175923fd20" 17592186322785 "q-10457/selection/9cb3e8ccd64a5262fb1ca22e091570b24b9b6773be9f42c52eabae88a1a464df" 17592186322786 "q-10457/selection/b46e9f34878c37dd0a512efbdb2d42d377c936c1c4a6beb37cd947e2d69c2005" 17592186322787 "q-10457/selection/d3db036eb4f1416f89daf27f7e46d53e24a869a31cc6cb40340d797b0a145530" 17592186322788 "q-348729" 17592186322789 "q-348729/field-1" 17592186322790 "q-348729/field-1/f37b140e44c3c1469a0b674232c5aaeb4f71e6e7b8d79e0c213b062c66caacc7" 17592186322791 "q-348729/field-1/f71b1e38493ea9fed9b52b1a449a78ef1253f46ade5679d6ac31d7029f4f688f" 17592186322792}}
